  - Updated card tab badge and active card header badge: Render amber `Media Pending` badge with `Clock` icon instead of `Published` when `card.publishedId` exists on a card in `stagedCards`.
  - Updated `handlePublishAll`: Partitioned `validCards` into `cardsNeedingListing` and cards with existing `publishedId`. Calls `createBatchProperties` ONLY for cards without `publishedId`. Reuses `card.publishedId` directly for media upload.
  - Guarded `failedCreateCount` check when `res` is null (media-only resume).
