- Full backend test suite: 352/352 PASS (`mvn test`, BUILD SUCCESS, 0 failures, 0 errors).
- Backend compilation: `mvn clean compile` PASS (BUILD SUCCESS).
- Full frontend test suite: 263/263 PASS across 11 suites (`node --test frontend-web/src/tests/*.test.mjs`, 0 failures).
