- **Root Cause**:
  - The Cloudinary Java SDK `uploader().upload(Object file, Map options)` contract accepts `byte[]`, `java.io.File`, or `String` (URL/data URI), but not raw `InputStream`.
  - In `CloudinaryService.java`, both chunked and non-chunked uploads were passing an `InputStream`.
  - `uploadLarge` natively handles `InputStream`, allowing videos to succeed, whereas standard `upload` rejected the stream with `IOException`.

